# No AI co-contributors

Never add any of the following to commit messages, PR bodies, or code comments:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`
- `Co-authored-by: Claude` / `noreply@anthropic.com`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- Any other AI / agent attribution trailer

Commits and PRs must be authored only as the repo owner (Adam / MarkockiAdam). Do not pass `--trailer` for AI tools. If a trailer is injected by the environment, strip it before pushing.
